Notebook[{
Cell["Sandpile", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"dbdc7821-0478-4129-89a6-dd2eff4d35a7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Simulaci\[OAcute]n directa del modelo de pila de arena (Bak\[Dash]Tang\
\[Dash]Wiesenfeld), no como aut\[OAcute]mata celular. En cada paso de tiempo \
cae un grano de arena en cada generador y la pila se relaja por completo \
antes del siguiente paso: toda celda con ",
 StyleBox["umbral", "TI"],
 " granos o m\[AAcute]s se derrumba y entrega un grano a cada uno de sus \
cuatro vecinos (arriba, abajo, izquierda, derecha). Los granos que salen por \
el borde se pierden."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4d0679c0-5870-42cc-a445-13b993a0f944"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Despu\[EAcute]s de relajarse, cada celda tiene una altura entre 0 y ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["umbral \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"dc02f597-2809-473a-9676-b96065f889a0"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"73efbc0b-7a3a-4065-9c4c-9c05ce0ea3fa"],
 ". Las celdas generadoras (donde cae la arena) se distinguen sumando ",
 StyleBox["umbral", "TI"],
 " a su altura: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cc776f6d-c93e-4d8b-8f43-95ae0e7513e2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Estados ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["0 \[Ellipsis] umbral \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d3d0ad20-f758-44d2-a8c9-2ebd1044e5de"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"d5f67e3b-54df-43f3-bb5c-059f05108299"],
 ": arena normal con esa altura."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"933b8997-684d-4875-a8b7-4c435ac28974"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Estados ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["umbral \[Ellipsis] 2 umbral \[Minus] 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"3eaddf54-d7e8-4e00-8d51-e96f5f9bd59c"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"081a662a-debe-4f28-9e7e-a8216b5e273f"],
 ": generador con altura ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["estado \[Minus] umbral",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"38ecec07-b2a9-4af8-9b6b-3bc349e03c6a"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"e787f6d3-e10a-4c69-9e3f-37dfbe789ddb"],
 " (crecimiento c\[IAcute]clico)."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f2ed2ee3-1156-4dd0-97ea-94a352dc2a9c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Con ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["umbral = 4",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"56750181-c043-4d42-a872-aaf81385df28"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"83b4ae60-69b7-4a9f-9fb5-087cb913ba80"],
 " los estados son 0\[Dash]3 y 4\[Dash]7; con ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["umbral = 5",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"cb373bed-77d3-400b-99db-813c302a9e3c"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"fe749f10-3264-4f0e-b330-bd6476398379"],
 ", 0\[Dash]4 y 5\[Dash]9. Se guarda el estado estable de cada paso, as\
\[IAcute] que la evoluci\[OAcute]n tiene ",
 Cell[BoxData[Cell["pasos + 1",
   Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"36fc7619-eb05-48ac-a612-e137a15bbb79"]], 
  "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->"490c7962-b6e2-4fd8-b93b-515e0c2c9ab8"],
 " cuadros (el cuadro 0 es el espacio vac\[IAcute]o con los generadores). "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"263ae749-f8dc-4ad1-92f9-0c682025182c"],

Cell["Par\[AAcute]metros", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"274e07b8-2f29-4dca-801c-0a7c735697a5"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetDirectory", "[", 
   RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lado", "=", "69"}], ";"}], "                       ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"espacio", " ", "de", " ", "lado", " ", "\[Times]", " ", "lado"}],
     ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"igual", " ", "que", " ", "las", " ", "pruebas", " ", "de", " ", 
     RowBox[{"B3", "/", "S23"}]}]}], " ", "*)"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"pasos", "=", "10000"}], ";"}], "                   ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{"granos", " ", "que", " ", "caen", " ", "por", " ", "generador"}], 
   " ", "*)"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"generadores", "=", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"35", ",", "35"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "        ", 
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"fila", ",", " ", "columna"}], "}"}], " ", "donde", " ", "cae", " ",
